<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Verity Report — Demo &lt;&amp;&gt; 東京</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; color: #1a1a1a; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .summary { padding: .75rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .passed { background: #e6f4ea; color: #137333; }
  .failed { background: #fce8e6; color: #c5221f; }
  .error  { background: #fef7e0; color: #b06000; }
  .skipped{ background: #f1f3f4; color: #5f6368; }
  .aborted{ background: #e8eaf6; color: #3949ab; }
  .suite { border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .suite > .hd { padding: .5rem 1rem; font-weight: 600; background: #fafafa; }
  .case { padding: .25rem 1rem .25rem 1.5rem; }
  .step { padding: .15rem 1rem .15rem 2.5rem; }
  .assert { padding: .1rem 1rem .1rem 3.5rem; font-size: .9rem; color: #444; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; min-width: 3.5rem; text-align: center; padding: 0 .4rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: .75rem; margin-right: .5rem; }
  pre { background: #f6f8fa; padding: .5rem; border-radius: 4px; overflow-x: auto; font-size: .8rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Verity Report — Demo &lt;&amp;&gt; 東京 <small>[dev &#34;quoted&#34;]</small></h1>
<div class="summary aborted">
  <strong>aborted</strong> (aborted) —
  suites 1, cases 2, steps 5 (failed 1, errors 1, skipped 1, aborted 1),
  assertions 2 (passed 1, failed 1) — 2000ms
</div>

<div class="suite">
  <div class="hd"><span class="badge aborted">aborted</span>Suite &lt;&amp;&gt; ☃ <small>(100ms)</small></div>
  
  <div class="case"><span class="badge failed">failed</span>feed case [row 2]</div>
    
    <div class="step"><span class="badge passed">passed</span>pass ✓ <small>[rest] 10ms · 3 attempts</small></div>
      
      
      <div class="assert">✓ status ✓</div>
      
    
    <div class="step"><span class="badge failed">failed</span>fail &lt;&amp;&gt; <small>[graphql] 20ms · 2 attempts</small></div>
      
      
      <div class="assert">✗ value &lt;expected&gt; &amp; &#34;quoted&#34; — got 東京; token=***REDACTED***</div>
      
    
  
  <div class="case"><span class="badge aborted">aborted</span>errors &amp; skips</div>
    
    <div class="step"><span class="badge error">error</span>error <small>[soap] 10ms</small></div>
      <div class="assert">⚠ transport_error: bad &lt;request&gt; &amp; ***REDACTED***</div>
      
    
    <div class="step"><span class="badge skipped">skipped</span>skip <small>[rest] 20ms</small></div>
      
      
    
    <div class="step"><span class="badge aborted">aborted</span>abort <small>[rest] 30ms</small></div>
      
      
    
  
</div>

</body>
</html>